#. @T["The website might be restarted upon saving the settings, potentially
#. leading to temporary unresponsiveness during the process."]
#: OrchardCore.Microsoft.Authentication\Views\MicrosoftAccountSettings.Edit.cshtml:7
msgctxt ""
"OrchardCore.Microsoft.Authentication.Views.MicrosoftAccountSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"The website might be restarted upon saving the settings, potentially leading"
" to temporary unresponsiveness during the process."
msgstr ""
"Beim Speichern der Einstellungen wird die Website möglicherweise neu "
"gestartet, was währenddessen vorübergehend zu einer eingeschränkten "
"Erreichbarkeit führen kann."

